  - geocoding
  - postcodes
  - Hilbert curve
  - Damm check digit
  - open data
abstract: >-
  An address model, reference engine, registry and registry server for Burkina Faso: every one of
  8,369,987 compounds has a code made of the name of a quarter or village people already say and a
  number of three to five digits, unique in the country on its own, with the official address shown
  first wherever a commune has given one.
